Description: Auto DJ queue and sources from a touch screen
 Controls for what Mixxx offers only in context menus or the preferences:
 - [Library],AutoDjAddAllBottom: every track of the list shown (playlist,
   crate, search result) to the end of the Auto DJ queue, in the order shown.
 - [Library],crate_selected (read only, 1 while a crate's tracks are shown)
   and [Library],crate_autodj_source (that crate is an Auto DJ track source;
   settable).
 - [AutoDJ],random_fill: the preference "Enable random track addition to
   queue" ([Auto DJ] EnableRandomQueue).
Author: DecksmithOS
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-23
